Get Fit 🏋️

Get Fit is a workout management web application where users can explore different exercises, view workout details, create personalized workout plans, and save workouts for later.

🛠️ Technologies Used

* Next.js
* React
* JavaScript
* HTML
* CSS
* PostCSS
* DaisyUI
* Tailwind CSS

✨ Key Features

1. Workout Library — Browse and explore a collection of different workouts.
2. Workout Details — View detailed information about each workout.
3. Add to Plan — Select workouts and add them to your personal workout plan.
4. Save for Later — Save workouts that you want to try later.
5. Plan & Saved Management — View and remove workouts from your plan, while the navigation bar displays the number of planned and saved workouts.